      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Fulton, Mississippi, was incorporated on May 11, 1837, solidifying its status as a growing community in the region.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fulton%2C_Mississippi",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1967, Fulton became one of Mississippi's first towns to field an integrated high school football team at Itawamba Agricultural High School.",
